      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLEO'S STAR (2) hit the ground running and set it up early last time, clocking 29.82 with a 6 length win at this track over 525m and making it back to back wins. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. BROOKLYN GIRL (1) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (30.18) from Box 1 at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Expected to be in this for a long way. POINT BREAK (3) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 6 lengths at Sandown in a handy 29.50 beating Ferret's Knock. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ASSASSINATOR (4) profiles nicely over this trip.",
